{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10244","headline":"同舍弟佶班韦二员外秋苔对之成咏 · 包何","name":"同舍弟佶班韦二员外秋苔对之成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"每看苔藓色，如向簿书闲。\n幽思缠芳树，高情寄远山。\n雨痕连地绿，日色出林斑。\n却笑兴公赋，临危滑石间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}